### Add Proxy
GRPC localhost:55000/proxy.v1.ProxyService/AddProxy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocol": "PROTOCOL_HTTP",
  "host": "localhost",
  "port": 8888,
  "description": "Test",
  "enabled": true,
  "weight": 10,
  "auth": {
    "user": "foo",
    "pass": "bar"
  }
}

> {%
    client.global.set('proxyId', response.body.proxy.id)
%}

### Get Proxy Success
GRPC localhost:55000/proxy.v1.ProxyService/GetProxy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{proxyId}}"
}

### Get Proxy Failure
GRPC localhost:55000/proxy.v1.ProxyService/GetProxy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "not_found"
}

### List Proxies
GRPC localhost:55000/proxy.v1.ProxyService/ListProxies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 10,
  "page_token": ""
}
